    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "You mentioned your state of New Mexico. The energy sector overall is a huge source of employment there and clean energy also in particular. When you look at what's happened in your state when it comes to renewable energy, is there some kind of blueprint that you think the federal government can follow or is it very, very state dependent based on weather based on terrain based on geography?",
