  {
    "episode_id": 66385,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/6/66385.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "You mentioned obviously that in addition to renewables that New Mexico has a very large oil and gas industry as well. The issue of fracking is one on which Senator Harris and Vice President Biden disagreed during the primary. Can you help me? What is the ticket's position on this? Because they did not agree on this during debates. Is this a administration that would ban fracking that would only ban it on federal lands, wouldn't affect it at all?",
